      "league_masteryi": {
        "name": "易",
        "attack": "普攻造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。被动 <#ff9028ff>双重打击<>：连续第<#ffb900ff>4<>次普攻会追加一刀，造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。",
        "skill": "消失并免疫伤害和控制，<#ffb900ff>0.6秒<>内闪击<#ffb900ff>4<>次：先对目标造成<#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>，再随机斩击附近的敌人<#ffb900ff>3<>次（可重复），每次<#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% 攻击力<>。可以暴击。",
        "skill2": "先<#ff9028ff>冥想<><#ffb900ff>0.75秒<>：<#ffb900ff>1秒<>内受到的伤害降低<#ffb900ff>40%<>，<#ffb900ff>2秒<>内回复<#6aff55ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% 攻击力<>的<#6aff55ff>生命值<>。随后<#ffb900ff>5秒<>内普攻附加<#f5f5f5ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>20% 攻击力<>的<#f5f5f5ff>真实伤害<>（<#ff9028ff>阿尔法突袭<>每击<#ffb900ff>75%<>），下一次普攻必定触发<#ff9028ff>双重打击<>。",
        "ult": "<#ffb900ff>7秒<>内获得<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>45% 攻击速度<>和<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>45% 移动速度<>，<#ff9028ff>阿尔法突袭<>和<#ff9028ff>无极剑道<>的冷却加快<#ffb900ff>40%<>。"
      },
      "league_annie": {
