      "league_teemo": {
        "name": "Teemo",
        "attack": "Basic attacks fire a dart for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Toxic Shot<>: plus <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, and the target is <#78e85cff>poisoned<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>, taking <#a974ffff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>10% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> each second (every hit adds its own poison).",
