        "skill2": "When an enemy champion comes close, Teemo sprints: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>40% Move Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>, and <#ffb900ff>Camouflage<> (invisible) for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Guerrilla Warfare<>: he also gains <#ff9028ff>Element of Surprise<>, <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>40% attack speed<> for <#ffb900ff>4.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Teemo throws a mushroom at an enemy champion's feet. It arms after <#ffb900ff>1s<> and hides for up to <#ffb900ff>12s<>. When an enemy steps on it, it bursts into a toxic cloud: enemies around are <#78e85cff>poisoned<>, taking <#a974ffff>100<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>48% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> over <#ffb900ff>4s<>, and <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by <#ffb900ff>40%<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<>. Holds up to <#ffb900ff>3<> mushrooms."
