      "league_annie": {
        "name": "Annie",
        "attack": "Basic attacks throw a small fireball for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Pyromania<>: after <#ffb900ff>4<> spell casts (Incinerate and Molten Shield count as two), her next damaging spell <#ef5350ff>stuns<> the champions it hits for <#ffb900ff>1s<>; minions and monsters never use it up. She spawns and respawns with it ready.",
        "skill": "Annie hurls a fireball that deals <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>75% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>.",
        "skill2": "Annie casts a cone of fire, dealing <#a974ffff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>85% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>. She also casts <#ff9028ff>Molten Shield<> on herself: a <#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>; while it holds, <#ffb900ff>20%<> of the damage she takes is reflected, and she gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>30% Move Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>.",
        "ult": "Annie summons Tibbers onto an enemy champion, dealing <#a974ffff>130<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>70% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> around him. For <#ffb900ff>6s<> Tibbers follows that champion and burns enemies around him for <#a974ffff>14<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>8% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> every second; he leaves when the champion dies."
