      "league_missfortune": {
        "name": "Miss Fortune",
        "attack": "Miss Fortune fires her pistols for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Love Tap<>: her first shot at a new target (after she kills her last one, or when she has not fired for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>) deals <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40% AD<> bonus <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>.",
        "skill": "Fires a bullet that deals <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the first enemy hit, then flies on into the next enemy behind it for <#ff9028ff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>140% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> (<#ff9028ff>Love Tap<> included). If the first shot kills, the second one <#ff9028ff>crits<> for double damage.",
        "skill2": "Rains bullets on an area for <#ffb900ff>2s<>: every <#ffb900ff>0.25s<> enemies inside take <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>15% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> (<#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>120% AD<> in all) and are <#ef5350ff>slowed<> by <#ffb900ff>40%<>. Then she <#ff9028ff>Struts<>: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>40% attack speed<> and <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>20% move speed<> for <#ffb900ff>4s<>.",
        "ult": "Channels for <#ffb900ff>3s<>, firing <#ffb900ff>12<> waves of bullets in a cone ahead. Each wave deals <#ff9028ff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>45% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the enemies in it and can crit. Being <#ef5350ff>stunned<>, <#ef5350ff>rooted<>, <#ef5350ff>knocked up<> or killed ends the channel."
