      "league_malphite": {
        "name": "Malphite",
        "attack": "Malphite pounds with his stone fists for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Granite Shield<>: a <#e8d44dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> <#e8d44dff>shield<> that comes back <#ffb900ff>10s<> after it breaks. <#ff9028ff>Thunderclap<>: <#ffb900ff>10%<> more <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#ffdd8eff>armor<>, <#ffb900ff>20%<> while the shield holds.",
        "skill": "Malphite hurls a shard of the earth at an enemy, dealing <#a974ffff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>50% Ability Power<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> it by <#ffb900ff>25%<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>. He steals that speed: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>25% Move Speed<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>.",
        "skill2": "Malphite slams the ground, dealing <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>40% Ability Power<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>3% of his max health<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to nearby enemies and cutting their <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:attack_speed_0><#ceff99ff>attack speed<> by <#ffb900ff>20%<> for <#ffb900ff>3s<>. Then <#ff9028ff>Thunderclap<>: for <#ffb900ff>4s<> his basic attacks also deal <#ff9028ff>10<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>1% of his max health<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to the enemies in a cone ahead.",
        "ult": "Malphite charges at an enemy champion, immune to crowd control on the way. On landing he deals <#a974ffff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>60% Ability Power<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#6aff55ff>3% of his max health<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> to the enemies around him and <#ef5350ff>knocks them up<> for <#ffb900ff>1.25s<>."
      }
    },
